# op::seal
# ========
# Cryptographically binds the compiled Taxonomy Merkle root, clean master digest,
# and adversarially protected master digest to an immutable external timestamp proof.

seal(bundle, protected_master) -> sealed_proof:
  1. Sign bundle.merkle_root + sha256(protected_master) via internal::sign.
  2. Submit commitment digest to OpenTimestamps calendars (Bitcoin blockchain anchor).
  3. Emit detached .ots proof alongside the .copyright.json provenance manifest.
